{"id":"risa","lemma":"risa","pos":"noun","rank":2153,"glosses":["laugh, laughter (sound of laughing)","laughter (movement of the face)"],"ipa":"/ˈrisa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"risas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-risa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Recuerdo el sonido de tu risa.","en":"I remember the sound of your laugh.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/730857","words":[{"g":"memory"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"sound, noise"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Escucho risas.","en":"I hear laughing.","words":[{"g":"I'm all ears awaiting…"},null]},{"text":"La risa es la mejor medicina.","en":"Laughter is the best medicine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641729","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"better"},{"g":"medicine"}]},{"text":"Casi me muero de la risa.","en":"I laughed so much, I thought I'd die.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/805835","words":[{"g":"almost"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Adoro el sonido de las risas de los niños.","en":"I love the sound of children laughing.","words":[{"g":"to adore","l":"adorar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"sound, noise"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"child, boy","l":"niño"}]}]}